{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Sally Goes on a Safari", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Nature Around Us", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 1, "type": "position"}, {"content": "scholar > Nature Around Us > Safari", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 8, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "A2.2", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Describe characteristics of different people and their jobs.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"content": "The Language of Advertising ", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the Imperative form to give an order, a warning, advice, and to make a request.</br> Advertisers often use Imperatives to create excitement. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Book your trip today!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Enjoy delicious meals!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Experience Mother Nature!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "To make the Imperative, you use the base form of the verb. You do not use a subject. </br>The verb is at the beginning of the sentence, so it is stressed.", "type": "text"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Geographic Features", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you talk about geographical features, you talk about natural things like bodies of water, plants, and how the land looks.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Geographic features include things like:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":7,\"columns\":4,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"desert\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"image\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"engenn5le08ob01img01.jpg\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"hill\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"image\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"engenn5le08ob01img05.jpg\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"mountain\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"image\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"engenn5le08ob01img02.jpg\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"island\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"image\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"engenn5le08ob01img06.jpg\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the bush\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"image\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"engenn5le08ob01img03.jpg\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"delta\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"image\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"engenn5le08ob01img07.jpg\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"river\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"image\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"engenn5le08ob01img04.jpg\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "safari", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a trip to see wild animals, especially in Africa", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I would like to go on a safari.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le08ob01aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you hear when traveling.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "unforgettable", "type": "name"}, {"content": "something you will never forget", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: This will be an unforgettable trip!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le08ob01aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "untouched ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "not changed or affected in any way", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: This is a place that is untouched by man.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le08ob01aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "the bush", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an area of land that is free of humans; wild", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  We are in the bush of southern Africa.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le08ob01aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "jeep", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a type of car made for traveling over rough ground", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Drive in an open jeep through Africa.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le08ob01aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to accompany", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to go somewhere with someone", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: A guide will accompany you.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le08ob01aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "armed guard", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a guard who carries a gun", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: An armed guard will accompany the jeep.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le08ob01aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "luxury tent", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a large shelter that consists of a sheet of white canvas supported by poles and ropes", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Relax in your own luxury tent.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le08ob01aud08", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "base camp", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the main campsite which provides supplies, shelter, and communications for people on a safari ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: If you get lost, meet us at the base camp.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le08ob01aud09", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "delta", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an area of low land where a river spreads into many smaller rivers", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Explore the deltas of Africa.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le08ob01aud10", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"content": "engenn5le08ob01re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Choose a country in Africa.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a short ad (30-40 words) for a safari in that country.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Remember to use Imperatives.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read your ad aloud to a partner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Listen to their ad.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I talk about travel.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I use Imperatives.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I use geographic features.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I read my ad aloud.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "video", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "Do you want to go on an adventure? Visit an island? What about a 5-day African safari?\nBook your safari now!\n<br>You will experience 5 unforgettable days on safari in the bush of southern Africa."}, {"image": "", "time": "15000", "id": 2, "text": "See Africa's \"Big Five\" in a place where nature is still untouched by modern man.\n<br/>Drive in an open jeep and walk through the wild bush. A guide and an armed guard will accompany you."}, {"image": "", "time": "27500", "id": 3, "text": "Relax in your own luxury tent at base camp. Enjoy excellent meals prepared by expert chefs.\nAll this and more is waiting for you in Botswana's Okavango Delta!"}, {"image": "", "time": "40000", "id": 4, "text": "Which animals do you hope to see? <br>Call us today at 267 309 3379 or send an e-mail to wildlife@gaberonetours.com with your name and telephone number to receive more information!"}], "video_src": "